content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Seller",
      "description": "User who lists and sells second-hand items."
    },
    {
      "name": "Item Listing",
      "description": "Entry in the marketplace showing an item’s details and price.",
      "attributes": [
        "Item",
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Item",
      "description": "The physical or digital good being sold."
    },
    {
      "name": "Price",
      "description": "The monetary value set for the listed item."
    },
    {
      "name": "Buyer",
      "description": "User who browses listings and purchases items."
    },
    {
      "name": "Order",
      "description": "Purchase request created by a buyer for a specific listing."
    },
    {
      "name": "Package",
      "description": "Container prepared by the seller to ship the sold item.",
      "attributes": [
        "Item"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shipping Carrier",
      "description": "Company responsible for delivering packages from sellers to buyers."
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketplace Catalogue",
      "description": "Collection of all item listings available in the marketplace.",
      "attributes": [
        "Item Listing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shipment",
      "description": "Delivery process that tracks the package’s status.",
      "attributes": [
        "Status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "description": "Current state of the shipment (e.g., pending, in transit, delivered)."
    },
    {
      "name": "Message",
      "description": "Communication sent between buyer and seller."
    },
    {
      "name": "Dispatch Confirmation",
      "description": "Notification confirming the item has been shipped."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Review left by a buyer about the seller or item."
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketplace Administrator",
      "description": "Person who oversees listings and manages marketplace operations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Refund Request",
      "description": "Request submitted by a buyer for reimbursement after an issue."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Purchase": {
      "objects": [
        "Buyer",
        "Marketplace Catalogue",
        "Order"
      ]
    },
    "Shipping": {
      "objects": [
        "Shipping Carrier",
        "Package",
        "Shipment",
        "Status"
      ]
    },
    "Distribution": {
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Item Listing",
        "Item",
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "objects": [
        "Refund Request",
        "Marketplace Administrator",
        "Item Listing"
      ]
    },
    "Messaging": {
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Buyer",
        "Message",
        "Dispatch Confirmation",
        "Feedback"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Purchase": {
      "derived from": "Purchase Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Buyer",
        "Marketplace Catalogue",
        "Order"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Shipping": {
      "derived from": "Shipping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Shipping Carrier",
        "Package",
        "Shipment",
        "Status"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Distribution": {
      "derived from": "Distribution Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Item Listing",
        "Item",
        "Price"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Administration": {
      "derived from": "Administration Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Refund Request",
        "Marketplace Administrator",
        "Listing Record"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Item Listing -> Listing Record"
      ]
    },
    "Messaging": {
      "derived from": "Messaging Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Buyer",
        "Message",
        "Dispatch Confirmation",
        "Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Seller -> Offeror",
        "Buyer -> Bidder"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
